<title>FRANCE: French ministry says grain sowings up 3.2 percent.</title>
<headline>French ministry says grain sowings up 3.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French farm ministry on Wednesday revised up its estimate for 1997 grain sowings to 9.116 million hectares, pegging them 3.2 percent higher than last year's, compared with 3.0 percent growth seen last month.</p>
</text>
